/**
 * TIFF vectors encoded by ffmpeg (raw / PackBits / LZW+predictor / Deflate,
 * RGB + gray + 1-bit), expectations = ffmpeg's own decode to raw RGB. TIFF is
 * lossless, so RGB inputs compare exactly; gray/mono compare against ffmpeg's
 * grayscale conversion with ±1 wobble allowed.
 */
class TiffDecoderTest {

